2	// Tensor cores (mma.m16n8k16), ldmatrix, cp.async, online softmax in
3	// registers, 128B XOR swizzled shared memory. BLOCK_M=128 x BLOCK_N=64.
4	//
5	// Partitioning: one block per (query tile of 128 rows, batch*head).
6	// 8 warps; each warp owns 16 query rows (one m16 slab) and computes
7	// S(16x64) = Q(16x128) x K^T(128x64), online softmax, then
8	// O(16x128) += P(16x64) x V(64x128), all with mma.m16n8k16.
9	// k/v may have kv_heads <= heads (GQA): kv head = h * kv_heads / heads.
